= Cryptocurrency wallet — Technical =

Wallet security includes key generation, entropy, storage, signing isolation, backup/recovery, address derivation, transaction construction, user confirmation, and possibly threshold or smart-contract authorization. The security boundary depends on custody architecture and threat model.

== Modeling / security cautions ==
* wallet ≠ storage location of coins on the ledger
* wallet ≠ private key only
* self-custody ≠ automatic security

